WEBVTT

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.810
How can you forget the grief of those who passed away here

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:28.980
and laugh in this fabricated world with those who destroyed it?!

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.820
We were all fooled by Clyne's weak successor,
and ZAFT has changed since then!

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:42.370
To us Coordinators, the path Patrick Zala
took is the one and only righteous path!

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.870
It is very difficult to predict the impact
points of Junius Seven's fragments,

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.410
and there is the possibility that all of Earth will suffer from it.

