00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:34.480
Don't tell me it's for disaster relief.

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:38.650
Is there a fool in this world who'd
seek help from Phantom Pain?

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:42.360
It seems like the pseudo space people
have started something again.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.990
And that's the cause of this chaos, huh?

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.780
So, we were told to be in our units just in case.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.430
Will we be able to have another war again?

